<title>POLAND: WARTA SELLS INSURER STAKE FOR PLN 9.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>WARTA SELLS INSURER STAKE FOR PLN 9.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish insurer Warta SA sold American Insurance Group its 50-percent stake in the Polish American Insurance Company and its 25-percent stake in European American Underwriters Agency GmbH, Warta said on Friday.</p>
<p>Warta said in a statement it had received a total of 9.8 million zlotys for the stakes, whose assets had made up 2.75 percent of its capital.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
